    "description": {
      "value": "Vicious claws grow from your fingers. They are finesse unarmed attacks that deal 1d4 slashing damage and 1d6 extra damage of a type determined by the dragon in your bloodline (see the table in dragon breath). Your scales from blood magic glow with faint energy, giving you resistance 5 to the same damage type."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (5th): The extra damage increases to 2d6, and the resistance increases to 10.\n\nHeightened (9th): The extra damage increases to 3d6, and the resistance increases to 15."
    },
